# *.pdb / *.ilk are build debug symbols — ignored by default so releases stay
# small, BUT a matching .pdb is REQUIRED to debug any GUI crash dump
# (08-10 crash was unreproducible because no PDB was ever emitted).
# To ship a debuggable release, force-add the pair from a build dir:
#   git add -f dist/HamsterStore-GUI.pdb dist/HamsterStore-GUI.exe.attest.json
# The negation below keeps `git add dist/...` from silently sweeping the .exe in.
*.pdb
*.ilk
!HamsterStore-GUI.pdb